d his collection was incredibly vast. He often credited this telescope with his luck, saying that as long as he had it, he could escape any situation, no matter how dangerous. It is said he died confronting a demon seeking revenge for a stolen sword.\n\nHis last known words were \"Somehow this feels like an ending, yet I know there is so much more to find.\"","source_tag":"_t","target":"这副精致的望远镜曾属于一位著名的冒险家和探险家科斯汀·赫菲因。有此宝在手，赫菲因遍历了整个马基·埃亚尔大陆，在他死前据说他搜集了许多宝贵的财富。他相信这副望远镜能带给他好运，有此物在手，无论面对任何险境，都能死里逃生。相传，他死于一名恶魔的报复，报复他偷走了恶魔私藏的一把剑。他留下的最后遗言是“不知为何，这感觉像是结局，但我知道前方还有太多值得探寻的东西。”"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fb9fbd5fd82d3e307bc3da9b824a8844af177253c16c2cd3de9e8d5705dc8f1c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"090939c4e33ff79a040476212bed86b6988d3431ed66525557ab9c17b7f6a7b0","logical_entry_identity":"12316a837c6543833ba9db7d8b89c41e628d8df2fd8454fef5cd664f280f86d8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"the perfect killing device","source_tag":"entity name","target":"完美的杀人装置"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4fba9702346c7697bf8b91c3f4a1b88415d01862fbdd11f9ec0a28cc6f116e5f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"090b28858554f2c64db45f7808be8209c0bc85ba119035f89abf423b9a20e741","logical_entry_identity":"a54731f795f9fc991a7d5d53c0d3650b536cb6caec99dd9c28b5dda61b3d9910","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"An archmage specializing in lightning magic.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一位精通闪电法术的法师。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a622cb5b4d3e1491ed11118e30e8af6228551594e6b7635dd1a9b5964f5fdae3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"090f74856f4b5c1d5777c6f46e8db276c4a3266d81719e6d238e352e65f41d68","logical_entry_identity":"85daa5eddca6a6946496f65cbd397177f48070c760976c4bf308b7a971ba68e4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"wolf","source_tag":"entity name","target":"狼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d86dd9e6803f84154375f7171fd87b37e7f74da6c529a3901d8666d248188a4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0913cfa01e20c5573100f767ca252639cd3d3072f2216576a11dde3555fe415b","logical_entry_identity":"27ec9dd4e3929053856fdd3137745e6853c8fb65f698ad5e0b89f66f8dcc70cf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#As you level up you learn the talent tree: #LIGHT_BLUE#%s","source_tag":"say","target":"#GOLD#在你升级的同时，你学会了新的技能树：#LIGHT_BLUE#%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fba3c759726a13393755109e05ee410b778cd463ff71ce1e50952149f22d39f5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"0917b8452859071ef455ca13510d6a28d76ff712442bc4f808bdaac89cd00900","logical_entry_identity":"5289b6bad581ca75a536e72b4390c5bae0dee6277d2b7844c081ad2056981802","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"1. You will not talk about Zigur to the wider world, lest evil ears be listening.\n2. You will shun the use of all spells and witchcraft.\n3. You will shun the use of magic-cursed items.\n4. You will shun the baneful influence of arcane runes and burn any skin that comes in contact with them.\n5. You will not aid or abet any you suspect of wizardry or conjuration.\n6. You will take note of any you suspect of spellweaving and report their name and address to the elders.\n7. You will actively hunt down and bring suffering upon any you suspect of using magic, communing with spirits, demon worship, or any you suspect of aiding others in these acts.\n8. You will report to the elders all activity you deem suspicious, especially evidence of cults or secret societies.\n\nThese are the rules we live by, these are the rules by which we will save our world. All who fail in these rules will be purged with flame.","source_tag":"_t","target":"1. 你不得向外界谈起伊格，以免被邪恶之耳听见。\n2. 你必须摒弃一切法术和巫术。\n3. 你必须摒弃一切受魔法诅咒的物品。\n4. 你必须远离奥术符文的恶毒影响，并烧掉任何接触过它们的皮肉。\n5. 你不得帮助或纵容任何你怀疑使用巫术或召唤术的人。\n6. 你必须记下任何你怀疑施展法术的人，并向长老报告其姓名与住址。\n7. 你必须主动追捕任何你怀疑使用魔法、与灵体沟通或崇拜恶魔的人，并让他们受苦；任何涉嫌协助这些行为的人也必须受到同样处置。\n8. 你必须向长老报告一切你认为可疑的活动，尤其是邪教或秘密结社的证据。\n\n我们依这些守则而活，也将依这些守则拯救世界。凡未能遵守者，都将由烈焰净化。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4fa3a22bec29f437e99bbb49bca01424c7027400d1dab6475f559016